GET {{api}}/schools?featured=true&pageSize=9

###
GET {{api}}/schools/101

###
GET {{api}}/events?when=upcoming

###
GET {{api}}/events?type=fair

###
GET {{api}}/events?when=past

###
GET {{api}}/events/501

